,"parts":[{"text":"பெரிது","lemma":"பெரிது","gloss":"great/loud"}],"gloss":"is greater"},{"surface":"அவன்","parts":[{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"அவன்","gloss":"his"}],"gloss":"his"},{"surface":"களிறே","parts":[{"text":"களிறு","lemma":"களிறு","gloss":"male elephant"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"male elephants indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கார்ப்பெயல்","parts":[{"text":"கார்","lemma":"கார்","gloss":"rainy season"},{"text":"பெயல்","lemma":"பெயல்","gloss":"rain"}],"gloss":"rain of the rainy season"},{"surface":"உருமின்","parts":[{"text":"உருமு","lemma":"உருமு","gloss":"thunder"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like thunder"},{"surface":"முழங்கல்","parts":[{"text":"முழங்கல்","lemma":"முழங்கல்","gloss":"roaring"}],"gloss":"roaring"},{"surface":"ஆனாவே","parts":[{"text":"ஆனா","lemma":"ஆனு","gloss":"cease-not"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"do not cease indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யார்கொல்","parts":[{"text":"யார்","lemma":"யார்","gloss":"who"},{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"particle of inquiry"}],"gloss":"who indeed?"},{"surface":"அளியர்","parts":[{"text":"அளியர்","lemma":"அளி","gloss":"pitiable ones"}],"gloss":"pitiable ones"},{"surface":"தாமே","parts":[{"text":"தாம்","lemma":"தாம்","gloss":"themselves"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"themselves indeed"},{"surface":"ஆர்","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ஆர்","gloss":"Bauhinia (ātti)"}],"gloss":"Bauhinia"},{"surface":"நார்","parts":[{"text":"நார்","lemma":"நார்","gloss":"fiber"}],"gloss":"fiber"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செறிய","parts":[{"text":"செறி","lemma":"செறி","gloss":"be dense"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to be dense"},{"surface":"தொடுத்த","parts":[{"text":"தொடு","lemma":"தொடு","gloss":"string/weave"},{"text":"த்த","lemma":"த்த","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"strung"},{"surface":"கண்ணி","parts":[{"text":"கண்ணி","lemma":"கண்ணி","gloss":"head-garland"}],"gloss":"head-garland"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கவிகை","parts":[{"text":"கவிகை","lemma":"கவி","gloss":"protecting/liberal hand"}],"gloss":"liberal hand"},{"surface":"மள்ளன்","parts":[{"text":"மள்ளன்","lemma":"மள்ளன்","gloss":"warrior"}],"gloss":"warrior"},{"surface":"கைப்பட்டோரே","parts":[{"text":"கை","lemma":"கை","gloss":"hand"},{"text":"பட்டோர்","lemma":"படு","gloss":"fell/trapped"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"those who fell into the hands indeed"}]}],"literal":"Roar rising than the ocean is greater, his male elephants indeed / rain of the rainy season like thunder, roaring do not cease indeed / who indeed, pitiable themselves indeed, Bauhinia fiber / tightly strung head-garland / liberal-handed warrior, those who fell into the hands indeed","translation":"Greater than the roaring of the rising ocean are his male elephants; their trumpeting never ceases, like the thunder of the monsoon rains. How pitiable indeed are those who have fallen into the hands of this liberal-handed warrior, who wears a head-garland tightly strung with the fibers of the Bauhinia!","modern":"ஒலித்து எழுகின்ற கடலை விடப் பெரியது அவனுடைய ஆண் யானைகளின் முழக்கம்; கார் காலத்து மழையின் இடியைப் போல அவற்றின் பிளிறல் ஓய்வதே இல்லை. ஆத்தி மரத்தின் நாரால் நெருக்கமாகத் தொடுக்கப்பட்ட மாலையை அணிந்த கொடைத்தன்மை மிக்க அந்த வீரனின் கைகளில் சிக்கியவர்கள் யாரோ? அவர்கள் மிகவும் இரங்கத்தக்கவர்கள்!","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Vākai tiṇai (victory) and Arasavākai tuṟai, where the poet Sāttantaiyār praises the Chola king Pōrvaikkō Perunaṟkiḷḷi. The poet describes the terrifying sound of the king's war elephants, comparing their constant trumpeting to the thunder of monsoon clouds and stating it is louder than the roaring ocean. He then expresses pity for the enemies who must face this powerful warrior. The mention of the 'ār' (Bauhinia/Ātti) garland identifies him as a Chola king, while 'kavikai maḷḷaṉ' highlights his dual nature as a generous patron and a fierce warrior. The key words are 'களிறு' (war elephant), 'முழங்கல்' (roaring), 'கண்ணி' (head-garland), 'மள்ளன்' (warrior), and 'அளியர்' (pitiable ones).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,0.9],[0.9,1.7],[1.7,1.7],[1.7,2.0],[2.0,3.4],[3.4,3.6],[3.6,3.8],[3.97,4.5],[4.5,5.6],[5.6,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,6.6],[6.6,6.7],[6.87,7.53],[7.53,7.7],[7.7,8.1],[8.1,8.9],[8.9,9.2],[9.2,9.29],[9.29,9.37]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,0.9],[0.9,1.9],[1.9,1.9],[1.9,2.2],[2.2,2.2],[2.2,4.0],[4.0,4.1],[4.1,4.1],[4.1,6.1],[6.1,6.5],[6.5,6.8],[6.8,7.3],[7.3,7.4],[7.4,8.18],[8.18,8.9],[8.9,9.3],[9.3,10.4],[10.4,10.7],[10.7,11.0],[11.0,11.3]]}}